  "note": "Lean proves (2.24) only for x < 11815, where (2.21) takes over. Erratum: The remark after (2.24) (p. 38) says |sum_{n<=x} mu(n)/n| <= 1/(2 sqrt x) for all 3 <= x <= 7727068587, but mu(7727068587) = +1 and m(7727068587) = 5.6880854e-6 exceeds 1/(2 sqrt x) = 5.6880397e-6, so the bound fails already at x = 7727068587; the correct range is 3 <= x < 7727068587. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_2_24.py`)."
